      "formatted_time": "2025-11-05 19:10:15",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "str_content": "Tanglang Mountain Hiking Activity on November 9, 2025\n\n【Activity Leaders】: Yang Zhenyang, Li Wenyi\n【Registration Process】: Sign up via chain message -> Pay fee -> Join group chat -> Attend event (Registration is only complete upon signing up and joining the group chat!!! Capacity: 20 participants)\n【Event Date & Time】: 9 November 2025, 14:00-17:30\n【Meeting Time & Location】: 14:00, 9 November 2025 (Sunday), outside Exit C of Beidai Metro Station\n【Activity Intensity】: ★★☆☆☆\n【Route Description】: Outward journey: Longzhu Gate entrance → Liyun Path → Qingyun Terrace → Daguan Pavilion → Jimuge Pavilion (staircase route, approx. 1.7km, 1–1.5 hours) Return: Jimu Pavilion → Daguan Pavilion → Qingyun Terrace → Jimu Pavilion Path → Longzhu Gate Entrance (winding mountain road, approx. 4.5km, 1.5–2 hours)\nTotal distance approx. 7km, maximum elevation approx. 430m, cumulative ascent approx. 294m, total duration approx. 3 hours\n【Registration Fee】: ¥5 (covers Kunpeng Association's group insurance and guide services; all other expenses during the activity are borne by participants)\n【Transportation】: Group transfer via underground railway\nFor enquiries, contact hike coordinator Yang Zhenyang (18255581152). All rights of final interpretation reserved by Nanyan Kunpeng Society.",
